  - dataset_description.json: GeneratedBy entry for this enrichment.
  - README: the 16 movie runs of sub-A04 ses-7/ses-8 (outside the 2024 paper's 40 A04 runs) match the 8 audio-only + 8 silent-video control runs of the 2025 paper (Suppl. Fig. 4); which session is which and the clips are not stated.
  - stimuli.tsv: presented_duration_s (which held ranges such as 341.2-341.3) split into the numeric columns presented_duration_min_s and presented_duration_max_s.
  - dataset_description.json: Version 1.0.0 -> 1.0.1.

